      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-09-005\" hidden></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16106]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>1.4. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>HERPS IN PREGNANCY + NEONATAL CARE:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16107]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>50% HSV \u2013 1.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16108]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>50% HSV \u2013 2.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16109]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Neonatal Herpes:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16110]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Skin, eye, mouth = 30%.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16111]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Local CNS = 60%.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16112]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Disseminated = 70%</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16113]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>No miscarriage.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16114]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>No teratogenicity</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16115]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16116]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16117]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>Herpes Suspected \u2013 Refer to GUM PCR for </strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>diagnosis</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong> + contact training.</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16118]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16119]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>P</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><sup>0</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> Acquisition in 3</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><sup>rd</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> (&gt; 28 weeks) Ig \u2013 M +ve</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>St</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>andar</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>d dose treatment + suppressive therapy</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Acyclovir 400mg TDS till delivery</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> for 5 days(435)</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Lidocaine 2%</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> for</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>  </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Paracetamol for pain</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Within 6 weeks\u2019 risk of neonatal infection 41%.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>C/S</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>- Observe baby</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>- Routine care</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>[no swabs]</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Recurrent Herpes 1 \u2013 3%.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Treatment with std dose </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>(</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>435</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>)</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> if necessary, otherwise only symptomatic treatment.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Daily suppressive acyclovir from 36 weeks 400 TDS till delivery.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Normal vaginal delivery.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Ulcers Positive</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>           a</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>bsent      </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> @ time of delivery</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Observe baby for</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>routine</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> 24 hours.</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>care</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Well</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>- Discharge [no SWAB].</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>- Advice parents regarding any concern.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>P</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><sup>0</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> Herpes in 1</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><sup>st</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> /2</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><sup>nd</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> before 28 weeks.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Treatment with st</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>andar</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>d dose  + suppressive acyclovir from 36 weeks.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>SVD</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16120]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16121]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16122]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16123]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16124]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16125]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16126]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16127]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>&gt; 6weeks??</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>SVD:</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>- Inform Neonatologist.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>- Assess Baby sends swabs:</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'>Skin</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'>Oropharynx </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'>Conjunctiva</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'>Rectum</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>[SCOR]</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>Well</strong></span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>Not Well</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>- Acyclovir 20mg/kg</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>- I/V Acyclovir            TDS till results are</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>- LP is needed</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>         available. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>- No LP. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>(lumber puncture)</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16128]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16129]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><u><strong>Mother refuses:</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>1. I/V acyclovir 5mg/kg</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'> every </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>8hrs + neonatal acyclovir 20mg/ kg</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'> every</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'> 8 hours</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16130]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16131]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16132]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16133]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16134]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16135]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16136]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16137]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16138]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16139]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16140]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16141]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16142]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16143]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16144]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16145]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>P</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>PROM:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16146]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Recurrent:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16147]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>&lt;34 oral suppressive dose Acyclovir 400mg TDS till delivery + Erythromycin, steroid + </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>SVD</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16148]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>&gt;34 steroid + Erythromycin</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>+IOL</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16149]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>P</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>0</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> Herpes</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16150]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> before 34 weeks:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16151]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>MDT discussion regarding MOD:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16152]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Expectant management</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16153]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> I/V acyclovir </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>+ </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Erythromycin</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>+ steroid </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u>+</u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> c/s ac</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>cording</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> to MDT</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> decision</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16154]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Immediate birth \u2013 C/S.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16155]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>After 34 weeks, steroid + C/S.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16156]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>HIV + herpes:</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>suppressive doses from 32 weeks.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16157]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Urinary retention =&gt; </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>catheterize</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> the patient </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16158]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>15% =&gt; unknown either P</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><sup>0</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> or recurrent for confirmation PCR is recommended but not in primary.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16159]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>FSE, FBS, instrument can be applied in Recurrent.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16160]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16161]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16162]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16163]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16164]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16165]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16166]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16167]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16168]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16169]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16170]\">\u00a0</p>",
